Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:27.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到有食物和补给的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find a place with food, supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:42.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（老乔和小乔的烧烤屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面等着 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait outside, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你放哨 - 你才应该放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep watch. - You keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站都站不稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can barely stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你自己进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you go in there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我们以前这样做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - We've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你清场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you clear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该让我一个人做这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should just let me do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,厨房安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小乔的特别辣酱）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只剩那些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might be all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以从这里打死它 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can get it from here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 它很虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引它出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:14.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请完成 我未能 做到的事）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没法用斧子杀死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't do it with the ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,每颗子弹都很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bullet counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你回头需要那颗子弹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you needed that one later?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能找到什么 然后我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what you can find. Then let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好厨房不是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitchen wasn't empty after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:08:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我找到的 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My haul. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间也不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's as good as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 我搞的定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的门都是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the doors down here are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀 傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shitface!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来呀 - 别爆粗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有行尸 早就出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's one of them down there, they would have come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把门系死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tied the door shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得不够牢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think it'll hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 这个结很结实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - It's a strong knot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,双套结 肖恩教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clove hitch. Shane taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我记得他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天都会记起他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember him every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么话想对我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There something else you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.57,0:14:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑过今晚应该没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll have to do for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want any.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我只是实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. I'm just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有点平淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was a bit… pedestrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 平淡 - 也就是说无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pedestrian? - As in lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且俗套 - 俗套吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And played. - Played?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前在哪里见过 说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you seen anything like it before? Tell me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过一只大猩猩开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a gorilla drive a car before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但即使你将其陈列于博物馆中\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you put it in a museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.81,0:16:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不觉得那是艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna call it art.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你能跟你家亲爱的讲讲道理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, would you please talk some sense into your lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 别那样称呼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. You did not just call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意我家亲爱的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with my lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也觉得这… - 非常无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, the whole thing was… - Very lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且非常俗套 - 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And very played. - Oh, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别这样 不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, don't do that. Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩这样一唱一和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't start finishing each other's sentences, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,特恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是 整体感觉就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to say that the whole thing was like a monument to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人竭尽全力想标新立异\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone trying too damned hard to be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很高兴自己看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm glad I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我并不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though I did not love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我们没有烦到你 小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope we're not boring you, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能在营地久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that we should stay at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会把儿子带出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm not taking my son out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢肯定这地方是否安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if this place will work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我敢肯定外面一定不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know it won't if we go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切还有什么意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it even matter anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是在自欺欺人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we just kidding ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.49,0:17:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白是怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I see what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你倒说说看啊 米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, Michonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你善于用剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've gotten good with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这本事现在多有价值吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how valuable that is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道那让你多重要吗 - 那又有何用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what that makes you? - For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存的目标在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福的结局在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the happy ending here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本就不是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全算不上 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't anything close, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我不是 对我们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, not for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们的儿子也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the answer here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈到底想问什么 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what is the damn question, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把这瓶酒给开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna open the wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:50.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（为了胜利）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.36,0:21:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.24,0:23:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有新鲜的肉 过来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh meat right here. Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.83,0:23:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起走一走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.65,0:23:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.14,0:23:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.70,0:23:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.69,0:26:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.15,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了三个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed three walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.77,0:28:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gonna get in,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.95,0:28:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.09,0:28:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引开了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lured them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.01,0:28:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干掉了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.53,0:28:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让大家种地的时候 我没有丢掉技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't forget while you had us playing farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.23,0:28:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得如何生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still know how to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.23,0:28:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我们走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.15,0:29:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.26,0:29:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你来保护我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you to protect me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.64,0:29:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许根本就保护不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably can't even protect me anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.62,0:29:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没能保护好朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't protect Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.68,0:29:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没能保护好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't protect…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel or Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.83,0:29:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.54,0:29:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想种菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanted to plant vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanted to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们在哪 但你却不在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew where we were and you didn't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.57,0:29:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是躲在围栏后面坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hid behind those fences and waited for…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家现在都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.73,0:29:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们指望着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They counted on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.97,0:29:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们的领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were their leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.63,0:29:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.79,0:30:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.48,0:30:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了我也会很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be fine if you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.36,0:31:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.17,0:34:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.78,0:34:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.08,0:34:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.81,0:34:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.45,0:35:21.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:36:06.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里面的行尸抢走了我的鞋）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.21,0:36:13.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（但没抓到我）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.73,0:37:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.42,0:37:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.66,0:40:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.87,0:40:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.90,0:41:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.97,0:41:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.34,0:41:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.80,0:41:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.30,0:41:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.87,0:41:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.69,0:42:36.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请完成我未能做到的事 小乔）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.88,0:42:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.47,0:43:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.99,0:43:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你在一起时也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you even when I was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.37,0:43:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在营地时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.80,0:43:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出那事的人不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't you who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.34,0:43:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.88,0:43:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.96,0:43:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you could be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.97,0:43:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.90,0:43:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.76,0:43:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道为什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.82,0:44:20.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（老乔和小乔的烧烤屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.50,0:44:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have risked it,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.34,0:44:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,像那样出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}going out there like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.06,0:44:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangegerou.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.23,0:44:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.56,0:44:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好你找到了很多食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good that you found more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.57,0:44:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.26,0:44:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.56,0:44:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,六斤的布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}112 ounces of pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.28,0:45:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不可能让一切回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll never get things back to the way they used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.05,0:45:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.55,0:45:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前那样做全是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only clung to that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.80,0:45:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.11,0:45:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在她离去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.86,0:45:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.53,0:45:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个男人了 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a man, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.58,0:45:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个男人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.64,0:45:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.38,0:45:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.32,0:46:06.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巧克力布丁）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.75,0:47:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.89,0:47:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for you.
